      "text": "## The Big Picture: Tissue Is the Interface With a Hostile Environment, and Dose Makes the Poison"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-ENVIRONMENTAL-NUTRITIONAL-AND-TOXIC-INJURY.md#007",
      "path": [
        "07-ENVIRONMENTAL-NUTRITIONAL-AND-TOXIC-INJURY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
